{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Sir Percival was a knight of cunning and preferred stealth or indirect influence to overcome adversity. He is best known for retrieving Excalibur from a roving warhost of pixies. And for being the Knight who bested the fisher king’s trial in order to retrieve the grail for Arthur. Both tasks were more than a match for anyone who approached the task directly.","created_at":"2020-07-22T09:07:27.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"735422752210812969","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
